# Byte-exact vendored assets: web/vendor/** is sha256-pinned in
# web/vendor/manifest.json and the tectonic binary is a fetched binary.
# Without -text, a Windows checkout (core.autocrlf=true on the CI
# runners) converts the text-detected ones to CRLF and breaks the
# manifest verification.
web/vendor/** -text
packaging/tectonic/** -text
